  "releaseNotes": "Fixed issue with Picture inside TableCell in PDF writer.\nAdded support for preserving 'Mark as decorative' drawing metadata in DOCX files.\nFixed issue with exporting EMF images in HTML writer.\nFixed issue with missing floating table in PDF writer.\nFixed issue with missing content in RTF reader.\nFixed issue with loading HTML and RTF text in Paragraph.\nAdded support for PdfSaveOptions.FontSettings, ImageSaveOptions.FontSettings, and XpsSaveOptions.FontSettings.\nImproved WPF rendering implementation.\nFixed issue with missing line break at paragraph end in HTML writer.\nFixed issue with table cell spacing in PDF writer.\nAdded support for Markdown files.",
